        "highlights": [
          "Led digital transformation by identifying operational inefficiencies and implementing automation and AI-assisted workflows.",
          "Built Employee Portal 2.0 using Cursor and ChatGPT — from Google Sites prototype to a live custom portal with forms, pay calendar, and admin dashboard.",
          "Developed QR-based uniform inventory system (Google Sheets, AppSheet, Apps Script) with AI-assisted scripting and documentation.",
          "Maintained operational, financial, and personnel data systems across Excel, ADP Workforce, and compliance portals.",
          "Created SOPs, HR policies, and training materials using ChatGPT; provided end-user IT support and technology training."
        ]
